{
  "case_id": "2008-07-6984",
  "document_hash": "38567c9e646c0a9139a2e7d58596f5a7c4c39963ec89c992f911aa63916a923b",
  "records": [
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "2008-07-6984",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "38567c9e646c0a9139a2e7d58596f5a7c4c39963ec89c992f911aa63916a923b",
      "evidence_id": "ev-38567c9e646c-0000-0000",
      "kind": "procedural_event",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 1,
        "start": 1
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "The above-entitled matter came on for oral argument before the Supreme Court of the United States at 12:59 p.m."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Chief Justice Roberts",
      "case_id": "2008-07-6984",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "38567c9e646c0a9139a2e7d58596f5a7c4c39963ec89c992f911aa63916a923b",
      "evidence_id": "ev-38567c9e646c-0000-0001",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 3,
        "start": 3
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "CHIEF JUSTICE ROBERTS: We will hear argument next in Case 07-6984, Jimenez v. Quarterman."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
      "case_id": "2008-07-6984",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "38567c9e646c0a9139a2e7d58596f5a7c4c39963ec89c992f911aa63916a923b",
      "evidence_id": "ev-38567c9e646c-0000-0002",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 4,
        "start": 4
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE KENNEDY: And you don't think you need to go beyond (A) to resolve the case?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Petitioner",
      "case_id": "2008-07-6984",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "38567c9e646c0a9139a2e7d58596f5a7c4c39963ec89c992f911aa63916a923b",
      "evidence_id": "ev-38567c9e646c-0000-0005",
      "kind": "stated_consequence",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 16,
        "start": 16
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "If he instituted it more than a year after the dismissal of the first proceeding, he is out of time, because there is only one final judgment, and that is the original dismissal."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
      "case_id": "2008-07-6984",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "38567c9e646c0a9139a2e7d58596f5a7c4c39963ec89c992f911aa63916a923b",
      "evidence_id": "ev-38567c9e646c-0000-0006",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 18,
        "start": 18
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE GINSBURG: May I ask if laches is something that the Texas court could bring up on its own, or is it for the State to raise or not as it chooses?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Mr. Goldstein",
      "case_id": "2008-07-6984",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "38567c9e646c0a9139a2e7d58596f5a7c4c39963ec89c992f911aa63916a923b",
      "evidence_id": "ev-38567c9e646c-0001-0000",
      "kind": "allegation",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 20,
        "start": 20
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "MR. GOLDSTEIN: He raises a substantive claim, like the judge was biased against him and the like?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Breyer",
      "case_id": "2008-07-6984",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "38567c9e646c0a9139a2e7d58596f5a7c4c39963ec89c992f911aa63916a923b",
      "evidence_id": "ev-38567c9e646c-0001-0001",
      "kind": "procedural_event",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 20,
        "start": 20
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "So his appeal was denied, right? He doesn't file an appeal in the hypothetical."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Souter",
      "case_id": "2008-07-6984",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "38567c9e646c0a9139a2e7d58596f5a7c4c39963ec89c992f911aa63916a923b",
      "evidence_id": "ev-38567c9e646c-0001-0002",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 26,
        "start": 26
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE SOUTER: Well, why should that be, given the fact that the day it is going to run from is the day that -- which the State of Texas is willing to take action."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
      "case_id": "2008-07-6984",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "document_hash": "38567c9e646c0a9139a2e7d58596f5a7c4c39963ec89c992f911aa63916a923b",
      "evidence_id": "ev-38567c9e646c-0002-0000",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 38,
        "start": 38
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE KENNEDY: Well, you're saying that (2) has a negative implication."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Petitioner",
      "case_id": "2008-07-6984",
      "confidence": 0.88,
      "document_hash": "38567c9e646c0a9139a2e7d58596f5a7c4c39963ec89c992f911aa63916a923b",
      "evidence_id": "ev-38567c9e646c-0002-0006",
      "kind": "stated_consequence",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 38,
        "start": 38
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "the tolling would have gone on while -- throughout the out-of-time appeal."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
      "case_id": "2008-07-6984",
      "confidence": 0.94,
      "document_hash": "38567c9e646c0a9139a2e7d58596f5a7c4c39963ec89c992f911aa63916a923b",
      "evidence_id": "ev-38567c9e646c-0002-0001",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 40,
        "start": 40
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE SCALIA: That's assuming that he files the appeal within one year, right?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "2008-07-6984",
      "confidence": 0.96,
      "document_hash": "38567c9e646c0a9139a2e7d58596f5a7c4c39963ec89c992f911aa63916a923b",
      "evidence_id": "ev-38567c9e646c-0002-0005",
      "kind": "procedural_event",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 54,
        "start": 54
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "(Whereupon, at 1:58 p.m., the case in the above-entitled matter was submitted.)"
    },
